{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "ac5d829733fdb64f38428567b884f15dc3ad3f0bffe93fdd67287870ce96dbaa", "ja": "消えない炎", "zh": "永不熄灭的火焰", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "01973c2d8fbaeac8d3c5dc62c2cc9961f3ce242a0367b3f7a8b6c960f84547db", "ja": "灼熱少女のメンバーとプロデューサーは、\n打ち上げでお花見をすることに。乾杯に\n選んだ飲み物は全員バラバラだったが、\nそれこそが自分達の個性だと笑うメンバー。\nにぎやかで楽しいお花見が始まる。", "zh": "『灼热少女』的成员与制作人，\n一致决定庆功宴要去赏花。\n干杯时，所有人选的饮料都不尽相同，\n成员们却笑称这样才有她们的个性。\n热闹又欢乐的赏花宴就此开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "258f107db0b5c4df1af6feb3f1d92944c463b93c8c5a99d6f72b5b957fa1a73b", "ja": "（灼熱少女の公演は、期待どおりの……\nいや、期待していた以上の結果を残した）", "zh": "（『灼热少女』的公演获得了如我所期待……\n不，是超乎我所期待的成果。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0ff5064b9f0724bff7fc4855be3cb78031f9d8ea390579d269648628e54a4b62", "ja": "（今日は、メンバー全員での打ち上げだ。ちょうど\nいい季節なので、みんなでお花見をすることになった）", "zh": "（今天是所有成员一起庆功的日子。\n现在时节正好，于是大家决定一起去赏花。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0c7b018e1f2047f4ab48154f6eb5051de2878e2d27df31ca7e58ab6dc6ec1387", "ja": "さて、うまいこと穴場を確保できたわけだけど、\nみんなはまだ……おっ、来た来た。", "zh": "很好，顺利占到好位置了，\n但大家还没……哦，来了来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "7efe4ac17ac5e36c88fbe42947f1c58cce3b3b9df638bdef46234ec46a47144d", "ja": "{$P$}ーーー！\nいぇいっ！　いっちばーん！", "zh": "{$P$}───！\n耶！我第一名──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "eb186faea5c82fd6644ff0c4f50e0c37386b7cfdee6ca48d6b5d54cdbfb2e333", "ja": "たまき、にば～ん！", "zh": "环是第二名～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4d228f45de22f2054d5353a1272c874a2f249bb11dc8764e5ece36e15a611c70", "ja": "おっと！　おいおいふたりとも、\nそんな急いで来なくてもいいだろう？", "zh": "哇！喂喂，你们两个，\n没有必要跑那么快吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "d806f3cb280922a200a787705f13e4af00726dafdb481f64727820c1e1bc37a4", "ja": "なに言ってんの、{$P$}！\nいいお天気なんだから、走ったほうが楽しいよっ！", "zh": "你在说什么啊，{$P$}！\n天气这么好，要跑起来才开心呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1007_040tam", "source_sha256": "de8469fb71615f9fa767f8d22496f5cb0983f5d07d4170b0f6eedc8771eb5df0", "ja": "おやぶんもいっしょにかけっこしよー！\nたまき、こんどは負けないぞ～！", "zh": "老大也一起赛跑吧──！\n环这次不会输喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "5f95bc28110d0871644bc4e8e49c68c32db40cb58eb9f447e245abb44369926c", "ja": "ふっふーん。一番は譲らないからね、環っ！\n体力なら自信あるんだから！", "zh": "哼哼～我不会把第一名让给你的，环！\n我可是对体力很有自信！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "3d68dcc68b68071754357ec7ef933bfe941b98ab0a21e305e2e163388aba8449", "ja": "そーなの？　んじゃ、荷物半分くらい\n持ってってくれるとうれしいんだけどな～。", "zh": "哦～这样啊？\n那这些东西真希望你能帮忙提一半呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "55b533a9f52a3543e934df8ff5a2fe62dff0e9446bc4da08c3b77ac4a545223c", "ja": "ごめんね、恵美。結局、コンビニで買ったものは\nほとんど持たせちゃって……。", "zh": "抱歉喔，惠美。\n结果在便利商店买的东西几乎都是你在提……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "6594e80456263a3e5146f0b07d6883493323c0ec4308b56a30fe5c211b88c80e", "ja": "いいよ、別に。\n琴葉はでっかいお弁当箱持ってるんだし。", "zh": "哎呀，没关系啦。\n毕竟琴叶你提着那么大的便当盒嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "e275ad1e2b3d92074229db3e4b026f421acaf4fd07ccb8bc4cb502337fedb5d8", "ja": "ああっ！？　ご、ごめんね、めぐみー、琴葉！\n帰りは私が持つよっ、全部持つからっ！", "zh": "啊啊！？抱、抱歉，阿惠、琴叶！\n回程我来提吧，全部都给我提吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "041f2338f0a65d3ec3f5c5a472683d86622d6fedb19ac5da26b2f72f33a6eba8", "ja": "いやいや、全部はさすがに……あれ？\n美也はどうしたんだ？　一緒じゃないのか？", "zh": "这怎么行，再怎么说也不能全部……咦？\n美也人呢？没有跟你们在一起吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "ef314ab8157e8a88502cff2d37c186e7fba958e3d5261717637fae79da3abd30", "ja": "え？　あ、あれっ？　さっきまで一緒に……。", "zh": "咦？奇、奇怪？刚才还在一起呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "4e663347b51e5a3fb3cea3317a795eb6c05be57a96632cd526bd07e37bbd5bf9", "ja": "ん～……あ！　おやぶん、うみみ、あそこ！", "zh": "唔……啊，老大！海美美，在那里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "1858c6983093889cce1f161b7466916798c3042e243cb2e90c8a39fe8214de6f", "ja": "あー……。\nなんか立ち止まって、花とか見てるっぽい？", "zh": "啊……她好像是停下来在看花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "da35c6e26c4cb5f8b51db9300e0377024c97e4e6c24608c97b63d5ecb1312f8e", "ja": "ふふっ、美也らしいね。じゃあ、先に準備だけ\n始めておこうか？　美也が来たら、お昼にしよう。", "zh": "呵呵，真像美也的作风，那我们先开始准备吧。\n等美也过来后，就来吃午餐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1018_020meg", "source_sha256": "57afec77f2c73696fd4cfa1906aeca5f61ef2685af50834dfaf951efe2e873a4", "ja": "いや～、琴葉ってばさすがだよね～。\nいいお嫁さんになるよ、ホント！", "zh": "哎呀～琴叶真是厉害呢～\n你一定会是个贤妻良母！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1019_017kth", "source_sha256": "ab3e7eefba619d5473902cc6c8fd45ba9872dd9e8e3593d1e68b5b64b90e02e4", "ja": "お、お嫁さん！？\nも、もう。恵美ってば、変なこと言わないでよ……。", "zh": "贤、贤妻良母！？\n讨、讨厌啦，惠美你别乱说话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "9535cd1f57b8b6d17b14134ba9fd814bd8e9e411f09e1087102abcbd96f2e716", "ja": "うわあ、すっごーい！　これ、全部琴葉と美也の\n手作りなんだ！？　これが本物の女子力っ……！", "zh": "哇啊，好厉害～！这些都是琴叶跟美也亲手做的吗！？\n这就是真正的女子力……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "201be968fecbcb2022dddb0b3d199c6edf67bcbf1fcb8464afcb6b378ca07ce9", "ja": "はぁ、やっぱり、かなわないなー。\n私も、琴葉みたいになれたらよかったのになー。", "zh": "唉，果然还是比不上你呢～\n我要是能变得跟琴叶一样就好了说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1022_017kth", "source_sha256": "c51b1dfea1bedd1aba0710698c01c04e331abb3ad1584ac09c19ac338e1aa471", "ja": "海美ちゃんが、私みたいに？\n……それは、私がちょっとイヤかも……。", "zh": "海美想变得跟我一样？\n……可是我不太希望这样耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "e4d76a02c065a590157e0c0c2d8e416bd471474e98eb31934aa3f37ac331a49a", "ja": "えっ！？　ど、どうして？", "zh": "咦！？为、为什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "e72308b22e1eb2a796539776a1b6e27124ad7fd4b25e8f2b926c6894da9e8867", "ja": "だって、私は今の海美ちゃんが好きだから。\nもちろん、恵美も環ちゃんも、美也も。", "zh": "因为我喜欢现在的海美呀，\n当然还有惠美、小环和美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "04f362d51765b277fd8c5910052dd340f92f51c4ce77f5eb2988217521c221bb", "ja": "私は灼熱少女のみんなが大好き。今回の公演で、\nこうしてみんなと仲良くなれて、本当によかったから。", "zh": "我非常喜欢『灼热少女』的大家，\n真的很庆幸能够因为这次的公演跟大家变得这么要好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1026_017kth", "source_sha256": "26c4229fdccb40ce663f3107ac8eac1f2fd2fac21b524206ca502743d82ace06", "ja": "だから、私と同じになんてなってほしくないなって。\n海美ちゃんは海美ちゃんのままが一番だと思う。", "zh": "所以我不希望你变得跟我一样。\n我觉得海美做海美自己才是最棒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "25bf1233f438e816ab9b83fd0e38e49b87cb62043965548789767e15295baa75", "ja": "琴葉……ううっ！\nもー、好きッ！　琴葉大好き！", "zh": "琴叶……呜呜！\n讨厌鬼～爱死你了！最喜欢琴叶了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1028_017kth", "source_sha256": "e817bcf5413fde217b6e77e63f544a99cec67882e24909b057ab5bec45d446c7", "ja": "きゃっ！？\nう、海美ちゃん、危ないから……。", "zh": "哇！？\n海、海美，这样很危险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1029_020meg", "source_sha256": "61933571d3ce1cfd77bca8ae950b7b269635a1816a1525e59d4d59b612c60892", "ja": "も～、琴葉も海美も大げさなんだから……。\nま、気持ちはわからなくないけどね♪", "zh": "真是的～琴叶跟海美都太夸张了……\n虽然我不是不懂你们的心情啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1030_040tam", "source_sha256": "793e0c397f81b573e9e16df53cff87f06939e8f2f2f044c5e6c8fdc1f46a47a2", "ja": "たまきも、みんなのこと大好きだぞ！\nあとね、おやぶんのことも、だーい好き！！", "zh": "环也最喜欢大家了喔！\n还有老大也是，最喜欢老大了！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1031_p", "source_sha256": "a1f86dd28105d0176a0629be86ef8e04d1af9d27f960b4eaf9f5ae6e7678273c", "ja": "はは、ありがとう環。\n……お、美也が戻ってきたな。おかえり、美也。", "zh": "哈哈，谢谢你，环。\n……哦，美也回来了呢。欢迎回来，美也。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "36ed0cdc5d5575189ba64a722167025d769a28508e4f0b345ee8107eeef92993", "ja": "おや～？　みんな、なんだか楽しそうですね～。\n何のお話ですか～？", "zh": "哎呀～？大家好像很开心呢～\n在聊什么呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "b511b57aba62446a87b2e9ede55810c45d9d155a5b507f3ed1a0fc849c9a569e", "ja": "そうだな。\nみんな違ってみんないい、って話かな？", "zh": "这个嘛，算是在聊说，\n「大家都不同，但是大家都很棒」吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1034_042miy", "source_sha256": "3b8c792aab53a51ca9669fd767bc7fceddee5717bae184d7835081aa004d5a9f", "ja": "なるほど～、そうでしたか～。\nそれは、とっても素敵なことだと思いますよ～。", "zh": "原来如此～是这样啊～\n我觉得这是件非常美好的事喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1035_040tam", "source_sha256": "eb09ca6559f8ec1b0ce4c7dc769b501294fd4df44a52a1b79a24c15ada4f20a5", "ja": "みや、たまきとみんなは、ちがうほうがいいの？\nおそろいじゃなくて？", "zh": "美也，环跟大家不一样比较好吗？\n不用一模一样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1036_042miy", "source_sha256": "fecd351ea03d69e09599d8dc7c8e96ffd177cadf04f90d1f8cb2314597d11980", "ja": "そうですよ、環ちゃん～。それに、私たちは、\nみんな違う人間ですからね～。", "zh": "是啊，小环～\n而且我们所有人，都是不一样的人～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1037_042miy", "source_sha256": "ae0133db0d0d9f4c53c026f1636722713ccfd0602a1e458dbbf8c24dc701e8ff", "ja": "灼熱少女のみんなは、私が持っていないものを\nたくさん持っていますから～。違っていいんですよ～。", "zh": "『灼热少女』的大家拥有许多我所没有的特色～\n所以不一样也没关系喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1038_040tam", "source_sha256": "8d0e9df9fee1179c9fe017a6cc3c1eca25b105dc093f61aadb6d09b923b078be", "ja": "ふーん……。\nよくわかんないけど、わかった！", "zh": "是喔……\n虽然环不太懂，但环知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1039_020meg", "source_sha256": "133611bef344ec125209d29e147e3b09c48c45f453f4b5ef072262573b307ae1", "ja": "よーし！　それじゃ全員揃ったし、乾杯しよっか♪\nアタシと海美と環はジュースだけど、美也は？", "zh": "好──！既然所有人都到齐了，一起来干杯吧♪\n我、海美还有环都喝果汁，美也呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1040_042miy", "source_sha256": "65397425bfb6d0e573052cca60445fbc6dfd7fe67e0a6c3bc68be06f9aaff546", "ja": "そうですね～。では、\nこの水筒のお茶をいただきましょうか～。", "zh": "我想想～\n那就给我这瓶水壶里的茶吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1041_017kth", "source_sha256": "4f523579991e4c186d99d3c7343ffc97561576e9919f982efc3dd120fe6b88cb", "ja": "あっ、ごめん、美也。\nそっちの水筒はお茶じゃなくて、しじみ汁なの。", "zh": "啊，对不起，美也。\n那瓶水壶里装的不是茶，是蚬汤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1042_020meg", "source_sha256": "eae40005e0baad5b0798aaa1e91327ebd25434bdf36587fd60cec1e55f3a39ad", "ja": "えっ。\n……琴葉、しじみ汁で乾杯するの？", "zh": "咦？\n……琴叶，你要用蚬汤干杯吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1043_017kth", "source_sha256": "c95531f63c5844dfcc12a05722a22f82fcd0c672771cfc07baf19ab229ef519f", "ja": "好きなんだもん……。", "zh": "因为我很喜欢嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1044_p", "source_sha256": "0a6379836d51be854e8816b43d6d5426297e12e1b39a017178279aa29737cd65", "ja": "琴葉……。", "zh": "琴叶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1045_042miy", "source_sha256": "ef2e8ac5a77e6f2a424ed7a59c0493b26303b186d595a37fd0b4c0bb77e3d0f7", "ja": "では私は、お茶で……\n琴葉ちゃんは、しじみ汁で乾杯ですね～。ふふふ。", "zh": "那么我就用茶……\n琴叶就用蚬汤来干杯啰～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1046_017kth", "source_sha256": "541590d2da47bcd110aa0dceb47cbf9efa50ba381ac31a5a82a1ae8de47f0cf9", "ja": "あ、あの。\n{$P$}は、何にしますか？", "zh": "请、请问，\n{$P$}要喝什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1047_p", "source_sha256": "4df235ba3bea7f3b01c53aa9d54c1c935af68d33be815f01f2ea5e5d1c47769d", "ja": "そうだな……じゃあ、俺もしじみ汁をもらおうかな！", "zh": "我想想……那我也喝蚬汤吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1048_029umi", "source_sha256": "20a7ab5640e0b3d8a5aec602a94c5aa1f30bedcfc8ddb9e5fe594ea3eacdc9b3", "ja": "お茶に、ジュースに、しじみ汁に……。", "zh": "茶、果汁，还有蚬汤……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1049_040tam", "source_sha256": "b90863c5d2be6157ae2f8771f5c4e8283601628e94944603207c8581878548ae", "ja": "くふふ！　みんな、すっごいバラバラ！\nへんなの！", "zh": "呵呵！大家都不统一！\n好奇怪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1050_020meg", "source_sha256": "a62258dbb2c6c941380150be3a500c89a6f0d81ef748f7e4176dfcba2022b7fe", "ja": "ま、でもアタシ達らしくて、いいんじゃない？\nだって『みんな違ってみんないい』なんでしょ！", "zh": "不过，这样很有我们的风格，不是很好吗？\n因为『大家都不同，但是大家都很棒』嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1051_p", "source_sha256": "5388e9cdd0fbb92deda973cee2580b1f700f7b08c3921d5957f6d6f736cbe628", "ja": "ああ、そのとおりだな。\nそれじゃ、乾杯を……琴葉から。", "zh": "嗯，你说得没错。\n那么，准备干杯……琴叶来起头吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1052_017kth", "source_sha256": "76f7c59bf18dcdb3c3202516fa8eecf3fe933eb84b3e2f9ea1cbf2477c5450e9", "ja": "はいっ！　みんな、準備はいい？\n灼熱少女に……。", "zh": "好的！大家，准备好了吗？\n敬『灼热少女』……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0027_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0027_story_07_1053_017kth", "source_sha256": "c8797c7a640eff4449fb16f3cbc259b85a07fb069afa45c6d33c9bfe5b2616af", "ja": "かんぱーいっ！", "zh": "干杯──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
